  unitName: Parallel Tempest Dion
  unitId: 30607
  unitNumber: 1741
  description: A knight who once suffered a brutal defeat at the hands of the Oracle
    Knight, but is rumored to have become an expert with the sword by the time he
    faced the Holy Emperor. Had Dion survived the battle against the Holy Emperor,
    he would have most likely returned to his home of Vriksha to teach everything
    he learned during his journey with his friends to as many people as possible.
    He would have also continued to perfect his skills through further training in
    hopes of eventually redeeming himself in battle against the Oracle Knight.
  summonDesc: Feels good to be needed. I think what I've learned during my journey
    has taught me that.
  fusionDesc: I'm going to shoot for the top one more time, because I'm sure that
    when we meet again he'll be stronger than ever.
  evoDesc: The fight against the Holy Emperor may be over, but my journey isn't just
    yet... Not until I've beaten him.
  element: 3
  rarity: 7
